di; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg aria-hidden width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://kenney.itch.io/explore-makegame/donate\" class=\"button donate_btn\" data-donate=\"true\">Support This Game</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><h4>What&#x27;s this?</h4>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://makegame.org/\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">MakeGame</a> is a makerspace for indie game developers where they can share knowledge, work on their own projects and attend various events. This game is a digital recreation of the physical space and allows you to look around, hunt for collectibles and learn more about the venue.<span></span><br></p>\r\n<h4>Controls</h4>\r\n<table><thead><tr><th></th><th>PC</th><th>Mobile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Walking</strong></td><td>WASD or click &amp; hold</td><td>Touch &amp; hold</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Camera</strong></td><td>Right click &amp; drag</td><td>Touch side</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Interact</strong></td><td>Spacebar</td><td>Touch</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Options</strong></td><td>Click menu button (top left)</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table>\r\n<h5>Requirements</h5>\r\n<p>This game can be played using keyboard, mouse or touch controls. Compatible wit